(text "PWM1 = D0 / GPIO1; PWM2 = D1 / GPIO2; PWM3 = D3 / GPIO4; PWM4 = D8 / GPIO7." (at 20 221 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "3535dfe4-997b-5fc2-8f44-e5b7b675f494"))
(text "J15 → XIAO underside BAT+; J16 → GND. J17 → D10 / GPIO9. Never connect motors to 3V3 or USB 5V." (at 20 227 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "52058082-9988-5a97-b27a-771a914bf0a1"))
(text "GY-521: module VCC → XIAO 3V3, GND → GND, SDA → D4/GPIO5, SCL → D5/GPIO6; AD0 → GND." (at 20 233 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "f98b91c4-5f2a-5426-b728-1bfb166be1d5"))
